    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "61b45350-eb59-3945-9f82-b1f7fc97623f",
                "word": "Andean",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2238018-b8fe-3979-9e56-114e1c74a20a",
                        "entry_id": "61b45350-eb59-3945-9f82-b1f7fc97623f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or pertaining to the Andes mountains in South America."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e5dc747-0f6d-4ec7-838f-69b174386f40",
                                "sense_id": "f2238018-b8fe-3979-9e56-114e1c74a20a",
                                "text": "An imprisoned ex-president of Peru was released on humanitarian grounds on Dec. 6, stoking controversy in the Andean nation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "901874f5-9161-4dcb-bf1e-988432f19ecb",
                                "sense_id": "f2238018-b8fe-3979-9e56-114e1c74a20a",
                                "text": "Under the later Inca professional farms, the whole of the realm from the coast to the upper Amazon River became a flowering centre of plant domestication. More than half of the foods that the world eats today were developed by these Andean farmers. More kinds of food and medicinal plants were systematically cultivated here than in any other area of the world. Among them are potatoes, squash, tomatoes, beans, peanuts, peppers, papaya, cashews, pineapples, chocolate, avocadoes, mulberries, strawberries."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d965d403-ec4a-44bc-99c5-988903fea724",
                                "sense_id": "f2238018-b8fe-3979-9e56-114e1c74a20a",
                                "text": "As the world's drug habit shows, governments are failing in their quest to monitor every London window-box and Andean hillside for banned plants. But even that Sisyphean task looks easy next to the fight against synthetic drugs. No sooner has a drug been blacklisted than chemists adjust their recipe and start churning out a subtly different one."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ef43ee11-5f29-4a75-a031-db3a70238923",
                        "source_entry_id": "61b45350-eb59-3945-9f82-b1f7fc97623f",
                        "source_sense_id": "f2238018-b8fe-3979-9e56-114e1c74a20a",
                        "source_sense_description": "of or pertaining to the Andes mountains",
                        "target_lang_word": "andský",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "andský",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1e1a267-6db7-3451-bef3-9d45bb70150f",
                                        "entry_id": "d88352aa-0820-35e0-b6fc-7197ca8e4db0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "související s Andami"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2146a533-5000-4295-bfd3-17ff5dad9ee7",
                                                "sense_id": "b1e1a267-6db7-3451-bef3-9d45bb70150f",
                                                "text": "Hornaté krajiny jižní P[atagonie] náležejí různým horským systémům, z nichž první jest andský, který zaujímá hlavní hřbet Andův a táhne se jako jediné pásmo až k zálivu Ultima Esperanza na 72° 40′ z. d. Gr. a 51° 35′ j. š.."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "076b3753-0a3f-47cd-bc7d-2e1c4d127480",
                        "source_entry_id": "61b45350-eb59-3945-9f82-b1f7fc97623f",
                        "source_sense_id": "f2238018-b8fe-3979-9e56-114e1c74a20a",
                        "source_sense_description": "of or pertaining to the Andes mountains",
                        "target_lang_word": "andin",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "andin",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "032957cf-2641-31fc-af7a-9ba454d6c7c4",
                                        "entry_id": "811e37f1-89c7-35b9-9bfc-2b39270abb2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui vient des Andes, qui est relatif aux Andes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db3fe633-8caa-47ad-9d5e-b162b74532ab",
                                                "sense_id": "032957cf-2641-31fc-af7a-9ba454d6c7c4",
                                                "text": "Le bleu du ciel s’assombrissait déjà, et le soleil effleurait de ses derniers rayons les hauts pics des plateaux andins."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11698025-fb00-4b68-bed2-f6457ff004b9",
                                                "sense_id": "032957cf-2641-31fc-af7a-9ba454d6c7c4",
                                                "text": "Notre propos n’est pas de présenter ici une description exhaustive du magmatisme andin, qui n’est pas de notre compétence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "andin",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b199e2e7-adc0-3390-ae90-0ac0b90eac7d",
                                        "entry_id": "aab194de-bf8a-33da-9695-ce918dc60bc4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Variante de andain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cc69387-2dab-4ceb-9dd5-52f7353609a6",
                                                "sense_id": "b199e2e7-adc0-3390-ae90-0ac0b90eac7d",
                                                "text": "Dans quelques pays, en Beauce, par exemple, on distingue deux sortes d’andains ; l’andin proprement dit, & le \"sangle\". Le premier est toujours formé de deux couches l’une sur l’autre, dont les épis sont en sens contraire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
